  "method": "Edge 12 (west face on the fountain square, D07/D08, Review R5): one tall storey: three round-arched openings on pink-stone piers with pale grey panelled two-leaf steel doors and fanlights, under a quarter-round translucent awning and the white 'YASSER T. BARAKAT' fascia (no atlas cell: request); red tile roof edge at ~6.5 m with an AC unit (D07: doors 2.7 m = 170 px, eaves ~340 px above the pavement at the near end). Rest of the block: same single storey, market rows (rules).",
